#: ../../source/docs/case-study-fly-by-wire.rst:5
#: 1066661f919c4aa2bc59ea7c644157e4
msgid "Log Analysis Case Study: Fly-by-Wire"
msgstr "日志分析案例研究：线传飞行"

#: ../../source/docs/case-study-fly-by-wire.rst:7
#: 078616c888f84d279b5c5c036f0c2a47
msgid ""
"Analyzing flight logs can help you diagnose problems with your missions. "
"This case study brings you an example of a flight where, by analyzing the "
"log data, our resident expert, Andrew Tridgell, suggested increasing the "
"waypoint radius to correct the plane's failure to complete a neat navigation"
" path. The original forum posts can be found \\ `**here** "
"<https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arduplane-2-73-released?commentId=705844%3AComment%3A1265467>`__."
msgstr ""
"分析飞行日志可以帮助您诊断任务中的问题。本案例研究为您提供一个飞行示例，通过分析日志数据，我们的驻场专家 Andrew Tridgell "
"建议增大航点半径以纠正飞机无法完成整洁导航路径的问题。原始论坛帖子可在 ` **此处** "
"<https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arduplane-2-73-released?commentId=705844%3AComment%3A1265467>`_"
" _ 找到。"

#: ../../source/docs/case-study-fly-by-wire.rst:14
#: 3f41cc2cf9ba48bea0108b7c714a5d0a
msgid ""
"DIY Drones member Iskess posted these logs of his X8 plane using APM code "
"2.73. He described an issue with auto take off where his plane wasn't "
"achieving enough bank angle in FBW (only about 30 degrees) but used the full"
" 60 degrees perfectly in the auto modes. Iskess notes that the flight starts"
" off with a couple laps around a course of tightly set waypoints, and FBW-B "
"doesn't start until 77.2% through the log."
msgstr ""
"DIY Drones 成员 Iskess 使用 APM 代码2.73发布了他 X8 飞机的这些日志。他描述了一个自动起飞问题，他的飞机在 FBW "
"中未能达到足够的坡度角（只有约30度），但在自动模式中完美使用了60度。Iskess 指出，飞行从几圈紧密设置航点的绕圈开始，FBW-B "
"直到日志77.2%处才开始。"

#: ../../source/docs/case-study-fly-by-wire.rst:21
#: be173b4720714f269e9e28814ef02654
msgid ""
"5/23/2013 tlog file (1.9 MB) - Download from original blog post \\ `**here**"
" "
"<https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arduplane-2-73-released?commentId=705844%3AComment%3A1265467>`__."
" - `X8 Parameters spreadsheet file download (14 KB) "
"<https://download.ardupilot.org/downloads/wiki/other_files/X8Parameters.xlsx>`__"
msgstr ""
"5/23/2013 tlog 文件（1.9 MB）——从原始博客帖子 ` **此处** "
"<https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arduplane-2-73-released?commentId=705844%3AComment%3A1265467>`_"
" _ 下载。- `X8 参数电子表格文件下载（14 KB） "
"<https://download.ardupilot.org/downloads/wiki/other_files/X8Parameters.xlsx>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/case-study-fly-by-wire.rst:24
#: 706877ae512641b18ddfe89400a3cb0c
msgid ""
"By analyzing this data using \\ **`Mavgraph "
"<http://qgroundcontrol.org/mavlink/mavproxy_startpage#mavgraphpy>`__**, "
"Tridge was able to provide the following insight."
msgstr ""
"通过使用 ` **Mavgraph** "
"<http://qgroundcontrol.org/mavlink/mavproxy_startpage#mavgraphpy>`_ _ "
"分析这些数据，Tridge 能够提供以下见解。"

#: ../../source/docs/case-study-fly-by-wire.rst:28
#: 62364691c1034406b0925789f8ce255d
msgid "***May 29, 2013 DIYDrones; posted to Plane 2.x Software forum:***"
msgstr "* **2013 年 5 月 29 日 DIYDrones；发布于 Plane 2.x 软件论坛：** *"

#: ../../source/docs/case-study-fly-by-wire.rst:30
#: 4f4cca44793a478b85d26bad4884bd87
msgid "\"Let's look at the 2nd auto mission first:"
msgstr "「让我们先看第二次自动任务："

#: ../../source/docs/case-study-fly-by-wire.rst:35
#: 5e6e0e166ecb426db3fcd08344e3fb1a
msgid ""
"It clearly could do with some improvement. Let's see if we can find out "
"what's wrong."
msgstr "显然需要一些改进。让我们看看能否找出问题所在。"

#: ../../source/docs/case-study-fly-by-wire.rst:38
#: b83db71b7be540e8963ed6ceb1929606
msgid "First off, let's graph the demanded roll versus the actual roll:"
msgstr "首先，让我们绘制要求横滚与实际横滚的对比图："

#: ../../source/docs/case-study-fly-by-wire.rst:43
#: fb9eadd5248b4ee5966810b0ed024b5b
msgid ""
"That looks good! The plane is achieving the desired roll quickly and "
"accurately. Now let's check the pitch:"
msgstr "看起来不错！飞机迅速且准确地达到了期望横滚。现在让我们检查俯仰："

#: ../../source/docs/case-study-fly-by-wire.rst:49
#: dae2099ebcef4117b86ffa9f0b5d1ee4
msgid ""
"That's not as good, though its only off by a few degrees. The PTCH2SRV\\_\\*"
" parameters could do with some improvement. I'd add a bit of I term to that "
"(increase :ref:`PTCH_RATE_I<PTCH_RATE_I>` to 0.1), and also increase "
":ref:`PTCH_RATE_IMAX<PTCH_RATE_IMAX>` to around 1000."
msgstr ""
"效果不太好，尽管只偏差了几度。PTCH2SRV\\_\\* 参数需要一些改进。我会在其中添加一些 I 项（将 "
":ref:`PTCH_RATE_I<PTCH_RATE_I>` 增加到0.1），并将 "
":ref:`PTCH_RATE_IMAX<PTCH_RATE_IMAX>` 增加到约1000。"

#: ../../source/docs/case-study-fly-by-wire.rst:54
#: 72f27749fb9742098c57435ac0ad39b5
msgid ""
"That isn't the cause of the navigation problems though. Let's look more "
"carefully at the key nav parameters you have:"
msgstr "但这不是导航问题的原因。让我们更仔细地看您拥有的关键导航参数："

#: ../../source/docs/case-study-fly-by-wire.rst:57
#: c088a84cb10e4863aa429a38ccf6b75a
msgid ":ref:`WP_RADIUS<WP_RADIUS>`: 8"
msgstr ":ref:`WP_RADIUS<WP_RADIUS>`：8"

#: ../../source/docs/case-study-fly-by-wire.rst:58
#: 3b184ce2befd4d63b40e59335c82fd3f
msgid ":ref:`NAVL1_PERIOD<NAVL1_PERIOD>`: 18"
msgstr ":ref:`NAVL1_PERIOD<NAVL1_PERIOD>`：18"

#: ../../source/docs/case-study-fly-by-wire.rst:59
#: 9a07a7b7491f44e3aaac35190ac4a6f1
msgid ":ref:`NAVL1_DAMPING<NAVL1_DAMPING>`: 0.8"
msgstr ":ref:`NAVL1_DAMPING<NAVL1_DAMPING>`：0.8"

#: ../../source/docs/case-study-fly-by-wire.rst:60
#: c9564dee89d74f828564bd7e2c71710c
msgid ":ref:`ROLL_LIMIT_DEG<ROLL_LIMIT_DEG>`: 60"
msgstr ":ref:`ROLL_LIMIT_DEG<ROLL_LIMIT_DEG>`：60"

#: ../../source/docs/case-study-fly-by-wire.rst:62
#: c769e2d7783c47c193fc2e9695bffa60
msgid ""
"The one that is furthest off for this sort of track is WP_RADIUS. You are "
"flying at about 18 m/s on average, and your uBlox GPS will have a lag of "
"around 0.6 seconds which is about 11 m of flight distance, which means you "
"are not turning until you are past the waypoint. If that is what you want "
"then that's fine, but if you want the plane to turn neatly onto the next "
"track then you'll need to turn earlier."
msgstr ""
"对于这种航迹来说偏差最大的是 WP_RADIUS。您平均飞行速度约18 m/s，您的 uBlox GPS "
"延迟约0.6秒，即约11米的飞行距离，这意味着您在通过航点后才开始转弯。如果这正是您想要的，那没问题，但如果您希望飞机整齐地转向下一条航迹，则需要更早转弯。"

#: ../../source/docs/case-study-fly-by-wire.rst:69
#: 6f919e75ba754f96b8dde8738f42fe61
msgid ""
"Your :ref:`ROLL_LIMIT_DEG<ROLL_LIMIT_DEG>` of 60 degrees at 18 m/s "
"corresponds to a turn radius of 19.1 m. The plane also takes a second or two"
" to change attitude. (The X8 is not a fast response plane! It's more like "
"flying a manta ray). If we add 1 second of flight time for the attitude "
"change plus the GPS lag plus the turn radius, then you'd need to turn about "
"48 m before a 90 degree turn to end up neatly on track. (That is very rough "
"of course, but won't be too far off). So :ref:`WP_RADIUS<WP_RADIUS>` of 48 "
"or so will produce a much neater track."
msgstr ""
"您的 :ref:`ROLL_LIMIT_DEG<ROLL_LIMIT_DEG>` 为60度，在18 "
"m/s时对应转弯半径19.1米。飞机也需要一两秒才能改变姿态。（X8 不是响应快的飞机！更像是在驾驶蝠鲼）。如果我们加上1秒的姿态变化飞行时间加上 "
"GPS "
"延迟加上转弯半径，那么在90度转弯前需要约48米处开始转弯，才能整齐地回到航迹上。（这当然是粗略估算，但不会相差太多）。因此，:ref:`WP_RADIUS<WP_RADIUS>`"
" 设为48左右将产生整洁得多的航迹。"

#: ../../source/docs/case-study-fly-by-wire.rst:78
#: f64fa3a0e54f4163bcaa686d00485669
msgid ""
"I also think you could lower :ref:`NAVL1_PERIOD<NAVL1_PERIOD>` a bit more. I"
" don't see any weaving there, just xtrack changes, so I'd try 15 and see if "
"it weaves. You may even find 13 works well. You'll need to experiment as the"
" right value is very airframe dependent (and even depends on the type of "
"servo you have!). You may also like to increase ROLL_LIMIT_DEG to 65 for a "
"bit faster turns."
msgstr ""
"我也认为你可以将 :ref:`NAVL1_PERIOD<NAVL1_PERIOD>` "
"再降低一些。我在那里没有看到任何蛇形飞行，只是横向偏差的变化，所以我会尝试设为 15，看看是否会蛇行。你甚至可能发现 13 "
"效果不错。你需要通过实验来找到合适的值，因为正确的数值非常依赖于机架（甚至取决于你使用的舵机类型！）。你可能还希望将 ROLL_LIMIT_DEG "
"增加到 65，以实现更快的转弯。"

#: ../../source/docs/case-study-fly-by-wire.rst:85
#: 0f88b9e8f8ff467ba2b4afa47e64b2b9
msgid "Finally let's look at your altitude handling:"
msgstr "最后，让我们看看你的高度处理："

#: ../../source/docs/case-study-fly-by-wire.rst:90
#: 4d381afe52f746a69ee88b7b3682e34c
msgid ""
"The most noticeable thing is that you started the mission well above the "
"mission altitude of 61 m. It took it four waypoints just to get down to the "
"target altitude. That makes using the log for nav tuning harder, as the "
"plane was trying to descend while navigating. Once it reached the target "
"altitude it held it OK, varying by about 10 m. That isn't fantastic, but "
"tuning the X8 for good altitude handling in turns is very hard with the "
"current controller in APM. You'll need the new TECS controller Paul is "
"working on to get really good results. So for now I wouldn't suggest "
"changing anything there."
msgstr ""
"最明显的问题是，你开始任务时的高度远高于 61 "
"米的任务高度。飞机花了四个航点才降到目标高度。这使得利用日志进行导航调参变得更加困难，因为飞机在导航的同时还在尝试下降。一旦到达目标高度，它保持得还算好，偏差约为"
" 10 米。这并不理想，但在当前 APM 控制器下，对 X8 进行良好的高度处理调参（尤其是在转弯时）非常困难。你需要 Paul 正在开发的新 TECS"
" 控制器才能获得真正好的结果。所以目前我不建议在那里做任何更改。"

#: ../../source/docs/case-study-fly-by-wire.rst:100
#: 9e783a47569740b192909136eaae15af
msgid ""
"Regarding FWB-B, that can be a little tricky to analyze, and is one of the "
"reasons I added ELEVON_OUTPUT, as it makes analyzing demanded roll a lot "
"easier! As you'll see below, working out the demanded roll for elevons is "
"somewhat tricky."
msgstr ""
"关于 FWB-B，分析起来可能有些棘手，这也是我添加 ELEVON_OUTPUT "
"的原因之一，因为它使分析所需横滚变得容易得多！正如你将在下面看到的，计算升降副翼的所需横滚有些复杂。"

#: ../../source/docs/case-study-fly-by-wire.rst:105
#: d4421f73f4c7488bb0bba3faf923caf7
msgid "First we should grab the demanded and achieved roll when in FBW-B:"
msgstr "首先，我们应该获取 FBW-B 模式下的所需横滚和实际横滚："

#: ../../source/docs/case-study-fly-by-wire.rst:110
#: 311202d13ef842499c80bc81fe66b2da
msgid ""
"You can see that the X8 is achieving the roll that is being asked for fairly"
" well. The roll is a bit jittery in level flight (maybe elevons a bit too "
"loose? or wind effects? hard to say), but it does generally do what is being"
" asked of it."
msgstr ""
"你可以看到，X8 相当好地实现了所要求的横滚。在水平飞行中横滚有些抖动（也许升降副翼有点松？还是风的影响？很难说），但它通常能做到被要求的动作。"

#: ../../source/docs/case-study-fly-by-wire.rst:115
#: 99e25564cdda439c830280968a163205
msgid ""
"Now let's look at what your RC input was against the demanded roll. The "
"demanded roll is in blue, and your RC inputs are in green and red."
msgstr "现在让我们看看你的 RC 输入与所需横滚的对比。所需横滚用蓝色表示，你的 RC 输入用绿色和红色表示。"

#: ../../source/docs/case-study-fly-by-wire.rst:121
#: 76b26e85e0444070b9b732f880a4bde2
msgid "The RC limits you had set were:"
msgstr "你设置的 RC 限制值为："

#: ../../source/docs/case-study-fly-by-wire.rst:123
#: a705d5bb9b9b4806bcb9c407853ce608
msgid ":ref:`RC1_MAX<RC1_MAX>`         1936"
msgstr ":ref:`RC1_MAX<RC1_MAX>`         1936"

#: ../../source/docs/case-study-fly-by-wire.rst:124
#: 1a341b2e438d4cacb9441ac3ca4d71c3
msgid ":ref:`RC1_MIN<RC1_MIN>`         1012"
msgstr ":ref:`RC1_MIN<RC1_MIN>`         1012"

#: ../../source/docs/case-study-fly-by-wire.rst:125
#: 0ddd4110d5284f76b628026c67757a26
msgid ":ref:`RC2_MAX<RC2_MAX>`         1927"
msgstr ":ref:`RC2_MAX<RC2_MAX>`         1927"

#: ../../source/docs/case-study-fly-by-wire.rst:126
#: 68106bb2b8874321903c0b7a553f1ca2
msgid ":ref:`RC2_MIN<RC2_MIN>`         986"
msgstr ":ref:`RC2_MIN<RC2_MIN>`         986"

#: ../../source/docs/case-study-fly-by-wire.rst:127
#: 520c709989884950964943b370ea3c29
msgid ":ref:`ROLL_LIMIT_DEG<ROLL_LIMIT_DEG>`  60"
msgstr ":ref:`ROLL_LIMIT_DEG<ROLL_LIMIT_DEG>`  60"

#: ../../source/docs/case-study-fly-by-wire.rst:129
#: dd0725b2ce204057bbf61f0716a06022
msgid ""
"We can also see from this graph that you had a bit of transmitter trim. The "
"part of the graph where the nav_roll is zero shows your RC input was around "
"1420 for each channel. That is important."
msgstr ""
"我们也可以从这张图中看出，你有一点遥控器微调偏差。图中 nav_roll 为零的部分显示，你的 RC 输入在每个通道上约为 1420。这一点很重要。"

#: ../../source/docs/case-study-fly-by-wire.rst:133
#: 74852b858f01438aba0574d1cba0c6db
msgid ""
"Let's zoom in a bit on the part of the FBWB flight where you were trying to "
"turn hard right:"
msgstr "让我们放大一下 FBWB 飞行中你试图大幅右转的部分："

#: ../../source/docs/case-study-fly-by-wire.rst:139
#: 4b018523cd274442bedaa00cdfa78e0e
msgid ""
"You can see that your transmitter was not outputting values anywhere near "
"the limits that had been setup in radio calibration. The average of the two "
"channels was a bit above 1700, which is 320 above trim, and 227 below the "
"RC1_MAX."
msgstr ""
"你可以看到，你的遥控器输出的数值远低于无线电校准中设置的限制值。两个通道的平均值约为 1700 出头，比微调值高 320，比 RC1_MAX 低 "
"227。"

#: ../../source/docs/case-study-fly-by-wire.rst:144
#: 0e8cacdcc28a4a7e88435a453bc620f3
msgid ""
"So now we know its output is 320 PWM above trim, the full range above trim "
"is 1420 to 1927, and the roll limit is 60 degrees. It is a simple linear "
"proportion to get demanded roll, so that corresponds to 320/(1927-1420)\\*60"
" degrees of demanded roll, which is 37.8 degrees. That matches the nav_roll "
"the plane got and what it ended up flying."
msgstr ""
"现在我们知道其输出比微调值高 320 PWM，微调值以上的完整范围是 1420 到 1927，横滚限制是 60 "
"度。通过简单的线性比例就可以得到所需横滚，即 320/(1927-1420)\\*60 度，也就是 37.8 度。这与飞机获得的 nav_roll "
"及其最终飞行角度相符。"

#: ../../source/docs/case-study-fly-by-wire.rst:150
#: e89ec3ceaa9b4409b5390dc3ee7b2eca
msgid ""
"Note that I've done a few shortcuts in the above. The full calculation for "
"demanded roll with elevons is a bit messier. See the code in \\ `radio.cpp "
"<https://github.com/tridge/ardupilot/blob/master/ArduPlane/radio.cpp#L129>`__"
" in the ``read_radio()`` function."
msgstr ""
"请注意，我在上面做了一些简化。实际计算升降副翼所需横滚要复杂一些。请参阅 \\ `radio.cpp "
"<https://github.com/tridge/ardupilot/blob/master/ArduPlane/radio.cpp#L129>`__"
" 中 ``read_radio()`` 函数的代码。"

#: ../../source/docs/case-study-fly-by-wire.rst:155
#: bb0b076697b1483e8a45a4b07c5d033e
msgid ""
"(If you read that code you may understand why I don't like the ELEVON_MIXING"
" option and much prefer the simpler ELEVON_OUTPUT code!)"
msgstr ""
"（如果你阅读了那段代码，你可能会理解为什么我不喜欢 ELEVON_MIXING 选项，而更喜欢更简单的 ELEVON_OUTPUT 代码！）"

#: ../../source/docs/case-study-fly-by-wire.rst:158
#: 77e76b2cd720479baa79606c83bf3971
msgid ""
"To answer your question, your transmitter is giving RC outputs which are "
"much less than the :ref:`RC1_MAX<RC1_MAX>` and :ref:`RC1_MIN<RC1_MIN>` "
"values you have in the autopilot (presumably from when you did radio "
"calibration). That is why it isn't rolling over as much as you want."
msgstr ""
"为了回答你的问题，你的遥控器发出的 RC 输出远低于你在飞控中设置的 :ref:`RC1_MAX<RC1_MAX>` 和 "
":ref:`RC1_MIN<RC1_MIN>` 值（大概是你做无线电校准时设置的）。这就是它滚转幅度没有你想要那么大的原因。"

#: ../../source/docs/case-study-fly-by-wire.rst:163
#: 78b5f583888647fbb4507f1406086221
msgid "Cheers, Tridge\""
msgstr "致礼，Tridge「」"
